## Independent CI and Automation

For active mistakeknot/gensysven repositories, builds, tests, scans, schedules,
AI jobs, packaging, releases and deployment orchestration run independently on
zklw. GitHub hosts source and results. Inspect `zklw-ci status --repo OWNER/REPO
--json` on zklw and claim the repository migration task in campaign `mk-ag2s`.
Register new code projects with reproducible baseline checks through `zklw-ci
onboard`; finish registry review and fresh-guest verification before claiming
CI ready. Do not add Linux Actions jobs or Actions-controlled runners. Preserve
platform-specific execution, production destinations and publication approvals.

